 md:text-2xl"><span class="mr-1">1<!-- -->.</span><span class="">Schritt</span></div><div class="bg-recipe-step-right h-9 w-11 bg-left bg-no-repeat pr-3"></div><div class="bg-recipe-step-line mr-2 h-2 grow"></div></div><div class="mb-3 mt-2 md:mb-6"><div class="flex flex-col"><img src="https://www.einfachbacken.de/sites/einfachbacken.de/files/styles/1946_1460/public/2019-08/mango_smoothie_bowl_26961.jpg?h=4521fff0&amp;itok=i9HNfcEO" srcSet="https://www.einfachbacken.de/sites/einfachbacken.de/files/styles/576_432/public/2019-08/mango_smoothie_bowl_26961.jpg?h=4521fff0&amp;itok=YNHM8rda 576w, https://www.einfachbacken.de/sites/einfachbacken.de/files/styles/1152_864/public/2019-08/mango_smoothie_bowl_26961.jpg?h=4521fff0&amp;itok=vwvf2YRl 1152w, https://www.einfachbacken.de/sites/einfachbacken.de/files/styles/973_730/public/2019-08/mango_smoothie_bowl_26961.jpg?h=4521fff0&amp;itok=LzARERxG 973w, https://www.einfachbacken.de/sites/einfachbacken.de/files/styles/1946_1460/public/2019-08/mango_smoothie_bowl_26961.jpg?h=4521fff0&amp;itok=i9HNfcEO 1946w, https://www.einfachbacken.de/sites/einfachbacken.de/files/styles/700_530/public/2019-08/mango_smoothie_bowl_26961.jpg?h=4521fff0&amp;itok=H4-VP1kr 700w, https://www.einfachbacken.de/sites/einfachbacken.de/files/styles/1400_1060/public/2019-08/mango_smoothie_bowl_26961.jpg?h=4521fff0&amp;itok=W8E6PSZb 1400w" alt="Mango-Smoothie-Bowl" title="Mango-Smoothie-Bowl" width="2048" height="1536" loading="lazy" class="w-full" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 700px"/><div class="mt-1 text-right text-[9px] font-medium uppercase text-gray-400"><span class="">Foto: <!-- -->Brigitte Sporrer / einfach backen</span></div></div></div><div class="mb-4 mt-4 flex items-center md:mb-8"><div class="bg-cart-icon mr-3 h-12 w-12 min-w-12 bg-no-repeat"></div><div class="flex flex-wrap"><div class="mr-2 inline-block text-lg leading-8"><span class="font-semibold">2<!-- --> EL</span><span class="ml-1">Kokoschips</span><span>,</span></div><div class="mr-2 inline-block text-lg leading-8"><span class="font-semibold">300<!-- --> g</span><span class="ml-1">Mangos</span><span>,</span></div><div class="mr-2 inline-block text-lg leading-8"><span class="font-semibold">1</span><span class="ml-1">Banane</span></div></div></div><div class="mt-3 md:mt-6"><div class="html-text hyphens-auto [&amp;_li]:word-break-word [&amp;_h1]:font-brandon [&amp;_h1]:text-[46px] [&amp;_h1]:font-medium [&amp;_h2]:font-brandon [&amp;_h2]:text-[24px] [&amp;_h2]:font-medium [&amp;_h3]:text-[22px] [&amp;_h3]:font-medium [&amp;_h4]:text-[18px] [&amp;_h4]:font-medium [&amp;_span[data-type=timer]]:font-bold text-xl"><p><span><span>Kokoschips in einer Pfanne ohne Fett anrösten, auf einem Küchenpapier abkühlen lassen. </span></span><span><span>Mango mit einem Sparschäler schälen und links und rechts entlang des großen Kerns das Fruchtfleisch wegschneiden. Übrige Mango von dem Kern schneiden. Alternativ gibt es mittlerweile auch Mango aus dem Tiefkühlregal. Banane schälen und in Scheiben schneiden.</span></span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="stf-slot relative flex items-start justify-center bg-gray-100 pt-6 slot-recipeBetweenSteps my-6 lg:hidden"><div class="absolute left-1/2 top-1 z-10 flex max-w-full -translate-x-1/2 transform items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs w-full px-4"><span class="uppercase text-gray-500">Anzeige</span><a target="_self" rel="follow" class="text-primary hover:text-primary/75 underline" href="/app?utm_source=einfachbacken_organic&amp;utm_medium=website&amp;utm_campaign=adfreebanner">Anzeigen entfernen</a></div><div id="_R_el2hjdinpfiuodb_" class="[&amp;&gt;div]:m-0! relative flex w-full flex-col items-center justify-start min-h-[400px] md:min-h-[250px] [&amp;&gt;div]:top-31 [&amp;&gt;div]:sticky md:[&amp;&gt;div]:top-0"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 260 93" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" class="h-[75px]"><title>Einfach Ba