g leading-8"><span class="font-semibold">200<!-- --> g</span><span class="ml-1">Sojajoghurt</span></div></div></div><div class="mt-3 md:mt-6"><div class="html-text hyphens-auto [&amp;_li]:word-break-word [&amp;_h1]:font-brandon [&amp;_h1]:text-[46px] [&amp;_h1]:font-medium [&amp;_h2]:font-brandon [&amp;_h2]:text-[24px] [&amp;_h2]:font-medium [&amp;_h3]:text-[22px] [&amp;_h3]:font-medium [&amp;_h4]:text-[18px] [&amp;_h4]:font-medium [&amp;_span[data-type=timer]]:font-bold text-xl"><p><span><span>¼ der Mango in kleine Würfel schneiden und zum Garnieren beiseite stellen. </span></span><span><span>Restliche Mango, Banane und Sojajoghurt fein pürieren. Für heiße Tage kannst du die Früchte gerne vorher einfrieren.</span></span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex justify-center my-6"><a target="_self" rel="follow" class="" href="/app?utm_source=einfachbacken_organic&amp;utm_medium=website&amp;utm_campaign=adfreebanner"><picture><source type="image/webp" media="(min-width: 369px)" srcSet="/add-free-banner/billboard.webp 1x, /add-free-banner/billboard@2x.webp 2x" width="800" height="250"/><source type="image/jpeg" media="(min-width: 369px)" srcSet="/add-free-banner/billboard.jpg 1x, /add-free-banner/billboard@2x.jpg 2x" width="800" height="250"/><source type="image/webp" srcSet="/add-free-banner/large-mobile-banner.webp 1x, /add-free-banner/large-mobile-banner@2x.webp 2x" width="320" height="150"/><source type="image/jpeg" srcSet="/add-free-banner/large-mobile-banner.jpg 1x, /add-free-banner/large-mobile-banner@2x.jpg 2x" width="320" height="150"/><img src="/add-free-banner/large-mobile-banner.jpg" srcSet="/add-free-banner/large-mobile-banner.jpg 1x, /add-free-banner/large-mobile-banner@2x.jpg 2x" width="320" height="150" alt="Mehr Backen. Ohne Werbung. Ad-Free-Abo ab 0,99 € im Monat" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="block h-auto max-w-full"/></picture></a></div><div class="paragraph--ParagraphRecipeStep md:mt-10 mt-0"><div class="relative mt-4 md:mt-8" id="schritt-3"><div class="mb-6 flex items-center justify-center"><div class="bg-recipe-step-line mr-2 h-2 grow"></div><div class="bg-recipe-step-left -mr-px h-9 w-11 bg-right bg-no-repeat pl-3"></div><div class="bg-blue font-black-and-white flex h-9 items-center px-2 text-xl text-white md:text-2xl"><span class="mr-1">3<!-- -->.</span><span class="">Schritt</span></div><div class="bg-recipe-step-right h-9 w-11 bg-left bg-no-repeat pr-3"></div><div class="bg-recipe-step-line mr-2 h-2 grow"></div></div><div class="mb-4 mt-4 flex items-center md:mb-8"><div class="bg-cart-icon mr-3 h-12 w-12 min-w-12 bg-no-repeat"></div><div class="flex flex-wrap"><div class="mr-2 inline-block text-lg leading-8"><span class="font-semibold">1</span><span class="ml-1">Kiwi</span><span>,</span></div><div class="mr-2 inline-block text-lg leading-8"><span class="font-semibold">2<!-- --> EL</span><span class="ml-1">Chia-Samen</span><span>,</span></div><div class="mr-2 inline-block text-lg leading-8"><span class="font-semibold">1</span><span class="ml-1">Maracuja</span></div></div></div><div class="mt-3 md:mt-6"><div class="html-text hyphens-auto [&amp;_li]:word-break-word [&amp;_h1]:font-brandon [&amp;_h1]:text-[46px] [&amp;_h1]:font-medium [&amp;_h2]:font-brandon [&amp;_h2]:text-[24px] [&amp;_h2]:font-medium [&amp;_h3]:text-[22px] [&amp;_h3]:font-medium [&amp;_h4]:text-[18px] [&amp;_h4]:font-medium [&amp;_span[data-type=timer]]:font-bold text-xl"><p><span><span>Püree gleichmäßig auf zwei Schüsseln (ca. 250 ml) verteilen. Kiwi schälen, halbieren und in Scheiben schneiden. Kurz vor dem Servieren mit den beiseite gestellten Mangowürfeln, Kiwi, Kokoschips und je 1 EL Chiasamen garnieren. Eine Maracuja halbieren und mit einem Teelöffel das Fruchtfleisch direkt auf die Bowl verteilen. </span></span></p></div></div></div></div><div></div><div class="my-6"><div class="relative"><div class="relative flex items-center justify-center"><div class="bg-recipe-step-line h-2 grow"></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center bg-white pl-4"><div class="bg-brush-tip-left h-9 w-6 bg-contain bg-no-repeat"></div><div class="bg-ebd-blue font-black-and-white flex h-9 items-center text-xl text-white">Ernährungsinfo</div><div class="bg-brush-tip-right h-9 w-9 bg-contain bg-no-repeat"></div></div><div class="bg-recipe-step-line h-2 grow"></div></div></div><div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 sm:grid-cols-5 sm:gap-4"><div class="border-l-4 border-gray-200 px-2"><div class="text-sm md:text-base">Energie in kcal</div><div class="text-sm font-bold md:text-base">245<!-- --> <!-- -->/ Portion</div></div><div class="border-l-4 border-gray-200 px-2"><div class="text-sm md:text-base">Energie in kJ</div><div class="text-sm font-bold md:text-base">1025<!-- --> <!-- -->/ Portion</div></div><div class="border-l-4 border-gray-200 px-2"><div class="text-sm md:text-base">Kohlenhydrate</div><div class="text-sm font-bold md:text-base">22.2g<!-- --> <!-- -->/ Portion</div></div><div class="border-l-4 border-gray-200 px-2"><div class="text-sm md:text-base">Eiweiß</div><div class="text-sm font-bold md:text-base">7.9g<!-- --> <!-- -->/ Portion</div></div><div class="border-l-4 border-gray-200 px-2"><div class="text-sm md:text-base">Fett</div><div class="text-sm font-bold md:text-base">13.6g<!-- --> <!-- -->/ Portion</div></div></div></div></div></div><aside class="hidden lg:flex lg:w-1/3 lg:flex-col lg:gap-12"><div><div class="space-y-4"><img alt="" role="presentation" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" width="1386" height="11" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mx-auto h-1" style="color:transparent" src="/divider/desktop.webp"/><div class="w-full space-y-2 md:space-y-4"><div class="flex items-center justify-between py-1"><span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[18px] font-bold">Gesamtzeit</span><span class="text-[18px] font-bold">20 Min.</span></div><img alt="" role="presentation" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" width="1386" height="11" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mx-auto h-1" style="color:transparent" src="/divider/desktop.webp"/><div class="space-y-2 text-[18px] md:space-y-4"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span>Zubereitung</span><span class="font-bold">20 Min.</span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span>Niveau</span><span class="font-bold">Einfach</span></div></div></div><img alt="" role="presentation" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" width="1386" height="11" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mx-auto h-1" style="color:transparent" src="/divider/desktop.webp"/><div class="space-y-6"><p class="text-lg leading-7">So wird es schon beim Frühstück fruchtig und gesund! Frische Mango, cremiger Sojajoghurt und Chia-Samen sorgen für den perfekten Start in den Tag.</p><a target="_self" rel="follow" class="flex items-center gap-4 transition-opacity hover:opacity-80" href="/autoren/siggi-schuppler"><div class="flex size-[50px] items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full"><img alt="Siggi" loading="lazy" width="100" height="100" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="https://www.einfachbacken.de/sites/einfachbacken.de/files/styles/author_thumbnail_2x/public/2018-11/Siggi_Schuppler_64731.jpg?itok=z0cKm7Bn"/></div><div class="leading-6"><span class="text-gray-text">Rezept von </span><span class="font-bold">Siggi</span></div></a><div class="mt-0"><div class="text-sm uppercase text-gray-400">Veröffentlicht am <time dateTime="2022-08-10T09:16:54+0200">10.08.2022 - 09:16 Uhr</time></div></div><div class="hidden gap-2 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-2"><button type="button" class="relative whitespace-nowrap rounded stroke-current font-brandon font-medium ring-offset-inherit transition-colors focus-visible:outline-hidden focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:bg-disabled disabled:text-disabled-text bg-blue-ebd text-white hover:bg-blue-ebd/90 text-lg leading-6 group p-0 flex h-10 flex-1 flex-row items-center justify-center g